    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Health and beauty from within\r\nCAre, viTAlity, LOngevity. This is what CATALO stands for. It is our philosophy that true health and beauty radiates from within and we are committed to understanding your health needs and enhancing health through superior natural health supplements that nourish your body.\r\nIt all begins with care - a healthy body is vital for happy life - and by embracing all the goodness that nature has, we are proud to offer this wholesomeness direct to you and your family.\r\nWhen it comes to our products, we make no compromises. We are committed to delivering premium quality products that contains natural, high efficacy, high potency and safe ingredients which will provide the health benefits to our customers. We care because we treat your health as if it were our own."
    },
    {
